<title>FINLAND: Finnish T-bill auction raises 100 mln markka.</title>
<headline>Finnish T-bill auction raises 100 mln markka.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result of the State Treasury Office's T-Bill auction November 5 versus October 29  SUVK :</p>
<p>		     THIS AUCTION/PREVIOUS AUCTION</p>
<p> Maturity, days	 159/166     342/349</p>
<p> Avge yld, pct	 3.10/3.10    N/A/3.43</p>
<p> Highest yld	   3.11/3.10    N/A/3.43</p>
<p> Lowest  yld	   3.09/3.10    N/A/3.41</p>
<p> Amount, FIM million  100/50	nil/140</p>
<p> Bids, FIM million    100/350     nil/610</p>
<p>(Treasury corrects average yield to 3.10 from 3.11)</p>
<p>Total planned issue amount was 1.0 billion markka. After today's auction, the outstanding amount of treasury bills is 41,522 million markka, the STO said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358-9-6805 0245</p>
</text>
